# Git LFS — large binary artifacts.
# JasperStarter bundles third-party JARs (e.g. Arial.jar ~51 MB) and Odoo 15
# dumps/archives are heavy binaries that must not live in the main object store.
# New blobs matching these patterns are stored via Git LFS.
# NOTE: migrating already-tracked history requires a coordinated
# `git lfs migrate import` + force-push (see Task B5 of the backlog closure plan).
*.jar    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jasper filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.dump   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.zip    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
